WEBVTT

00:10:27.706 --> 00:10:30.459
You’ve extended grace to someone else.

00:10:31.126 --> 00:10:34.296
And I believe that when you remove
malice from your heart,

00:10:34.296 --> 00:10:36.465
not only do you feel better,
you look better.

00:10:36.965 --> 00:10:40.552
I think you lose your frown lines
and your wrinkles lessen

00:10:40.552 --> 00:10:42.513
and your age spots disappear.

00:10:42.596 --> 00:10:45.349
I believe it’s better than Botox,

00:10:45.349 --> 00:10:46.350
extending grace.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:47.351
I do.

00:10:47.351 --> 00:10:48.352
(Applause)

00:10:49.645 --> 00:10:50.646
Yeah.

00:10:51.522 --> 00:10:54.191
No, but let me get back
to the note thing.

00:10:54.441 --> 00:10:59.196
So one of my favorite notes
is from Willie Shakespeare.

00:10:59.905 --> 00:11:01.907
“To thine own self be true.”